OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fthe odd shower through the evening,
OL,7,Fbut these fade quickly. Cloud
OL,8,Fgradually breaking up overnight, with
OL,9,Fskies becoming largely clear, allowing
OL,10,Fisolated pockets of grass frost and
OL,11,Ffog to develop in prone spots. Minimum
OL,12,FTemperature 3C.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FAnother fine and dry start.
OL,15,FPatchy cloud forms through the day,
OL,16,Fbut plenty of sunny spells possible.
OL,17,FTurning cloudy from the west later as
OL,18,Fa rain band moves in overnight.
OL,19,FMaximum Temperature 8C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
