OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,6,Fdamp start to Thursday, as a rain band
OL,7,Fclears through the morning. Remaining
OL,8,Flargely changeable thereafter, with a
OL,9,Fmix of rain, showers and sunny spells
OL,10,Fto end the week.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
